<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Polaris said cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Polaris said cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Oppenheimer &amp; Co cut its rating on Polaris Industries Inc to market preform from outperform, a source at the brokerage said.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available for comment.</p>
</text>
